<html><head><title>Partners role</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-GB" lang="EN-GB" class="TextRun SCXW49285840 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW49285840 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">In transdisciplinary education, your role makes the difference because you </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW49285840 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">represent</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW49285840 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> the world outside the walls of the academies. The idea of transdisciplinary education is to bring education and science closer to society. In collaboration with multiple partners, solutions can be found for complex problems.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW49285840 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></body></html>